  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For balancing of force,&nbsp;</p><p>Magnetic force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>weight of supporting mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>L</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mtext>From&#160;Ohm's&#160;law</mtext><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>